ter=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849500/extras/f2d47c603d27aebc364ea81573f59345.poster.avif?t=1773068739\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849500/extras/f2d47c603d27aebc364ea81573f59345.webm?t=1773068739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849500/extras/f2d47c603d27aebc364ea81573f59345.mp4?t=1773068739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With their own inhabitants, environments, traps, and quirks, Heaven and Hell propose radically different experiences. You\u2019ll need to explore both to unlock all characters in Lost In Prayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So <strong>if you\u2019re tired of dying in one route,</strong> try your luck and skills with the other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter the path you choose, every floor will challenge you more than the last. <strong>Victory is going to be a hell of a challenge.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Nine Dots Studio"],"dlc":[3724840],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849500/a5990245dae56c713d33d24273e2c738a84e140b/header_alt_assets_3.jpg?t=1773068739","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9Nine Dots Studio, 2025","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2849500/208676168/cd7bb64da5973dd268537618af927c588cdc5e5c/1750947444/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748452437","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2849500/208676168/cd7bb64da5973dd268537618af927c588cdc5e5c/1750947444/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748452437","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers